///
/// Contract: `VG.Spec.MlDsa.signContract`. Constant time but for `ρ` and the rejection sampling: timing may depend on the pointers, on `ρ` (the first 32 bytes of `*sk`), on the number of iterations of the signing loop and the commitment hash of each, and on the hint of the signature (`signLeak`), but not on anything else of the key, the message representative or the randomness.
